From 8b7ee927bd3a16321ace3d376329145979a48776 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 21:45:46 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] metal: reuse routed vector activations across qualified chip
 geometries

Retain the M5 Max reuse specializations. Extend the owning capability with exact-shape Q4_1 down-only NR8 dispatch on M1 Ultra and base M4, guarded by token, selection and SIMD-group counts. Add opt-in native CPU-reference coverage and policy boundary checks. No shader or public ABI change.
